# Governance surface — requires James's review, never auto-merged.
#
# This file is what bounds the I6a merge grant. arbi and Guilfoyle may merge their own
# PRs once required checks pass (docs/product/arbi-permission-model.md), which would
# otherwise let the agent merge a change to its own charter, permission ladder, or
# guard hooks. Everything below is excluded from that grant: a PR touching these paths
# blocks on review regardless of CI status.
#
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" to be enabled in branch protection on
# main. Without that setting this file is advisory only.

# The agent's own authority, boundaries, and scorecard
/docs/product/            @Jp8617465-sys

# Agent definitions, slash commands, and the guard hooks that constrain them
/.claude/                 @Jp8617465-sys

# CI itself — a workflow edit could disable the checks the merge grant depends on
/.github/                 @Jp8617465-sys

# Project instructions the agents read as authority
/CLAUDE.md                @Jp8617465-sys

# Irreversible-by-nature surfaces (tier I5)
/supabase/migrations/     @Jp8617465-sys
/drizzle/                 @Jp8617465-sys
/eas.json                 @Jp8617465-sys
